ep_7":"In a bowl, mix ground walnuts with a little bean broth to create a paste","step_8":"Stir walnut paste into the soup","step_9":"Add chopped cilantro","step_10":"Simmer for 10 more minutes","step_11":"Season with salt and pepper","step_12":"Serve hot with bread"}
