ee half the soup for a creamy texture (optional)","step_9":"Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot"}
{"_id":"64b23c77-18fb-4d57-b498-4f87cefb5609","number":132,"title":"ONION SOUP","cuisine":"French","meal_type":"Soup","preparation_difficulty":"Medium","preparation_time":"1 hour 15 mins","servings":"4","image_source":"","source":"Traditional French recipe","validation":"USDA - onions provide quercetin (powerful antioxidant), vitamin C; Gruyère provides calcium (717mg/100g)","confidence":"Supported","tag_1":"luteal-phase-week-4","tag_2":"fertility-supporting","tag_3":"vegetarian","tag_4":"contains-dairy","tag_5":"calcium","tag_6":"calcium-rich","tag_7":"antioxidant-rich","tag_8":"protein","tag_9":"NONE","tag_10":"NONE","tag_11":"NONE","tag_12":"NONE","tag_13":"NONE","tag_14":"NONE","tag_15":"NONE","principal_ingredient_1":"Onions","principal_ingredient_2":"beef or vegetable broth","principal_ingredient_3":"Gruyère cheese","principal_ingredient_4":"baguette","principal_ingredient_5":null,"principal_ingredient_6":null,"principal_ingredient_7":null,"subtitle":"Soupe à l'Oignon Gratinée","freeRecipe":false,"ingredient_1":"1 kg yellow onions, thinly sliced","ingredient_2":"2 tbsp butter","ingredient_3":"2 tbsp olive oil","ingredient_4":"6 cups beef broth (or vegetable broth for vegetarian)","ingredient_5":"1/2 cup dry white wine (optional)","ingredient_6":"1 bay leaf","ingredient_7":"2 sprigs fresh thyme","ingredient_8":"Salt and pepper to taste","ingredient_9":"4 slices baguette","ingredient_10":"150g Gruyère cheese, grated","step_1":"In a large pot, melt butter and olive oil over medium-low heat","step_2":"Add onions and cook for 30-40 minutes, stirring occasionally, until deeply caramelized and golden brown","step_3":"Add garlic (if using) and cook for 1 minute","step_4":"Add wine (if using) and scrape up browned bits from bottom of pot","step_5":"Add broth, bay leaf, and thyme","step_6":"Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 20 minutes","step_7":"Season with salt and pepper","step_8":"Preheat broiler","step_9":"Ladle soup into oven-safe bowls","step_10":"Top each bowl with a slice of baguette and a generous amount of grated Gruyère","step_11":"Place bowls on a baking sheet and broil for 2-3 minutes until cheese is bubbly and golden","step_12":"Serve immediately (bowls will be very hot)"}
