dish, packed tightly","step_9":"Pour remaining olive oil and water into the dish (around, not over, vegetables)","step_10":"Bake for 45-60 minutes until rice is cooked and vegetables are soft","step_11":"Serve warm or at room temperature, with the cooking juices spooned over"}
{"_id":"d4aa1236-a8b0-4e29-8509-0d22cd72f0ff","number":277,"title":"LYUTENITSA","cuisine":"Bulgarian","meal_type":"Condiment/Side Dish","preparation_difficulty":"Medium","preparation_time":"1 hour 30 mins","servings":"Makes 4-5 cups","image_source":"","source":"Traditional Bulgarian recipe","validation":"USDA - red bell peppers provide extremely high vitamin C (190mg each); tomatoes provide lycopene","confidence":"Supported","tag_1":"follicular-phase-week-2","tag_2":"fertility-supporting","tag_3":"vegetarian","tag_4":"vegan","tag_5":"gluten-free","tag_6":"vitamin-c","tag_7":"vitamin-c-rich","tag_8":"vitamin-e","tag_9":"antioxidant-rich","tag_10":"lycopene","tag_11":"NONE","tag_12":"NONE","tag_13":"NONE","tag_14":"NONE","tag_15":"NONE","principal_ingredient_1":"Red bell peppers","principal_ingredient_2":"tomatoes","principal_ingredient_3":"eggplant","principal_ingredient_4":"carrots","principal_ingredient_5":null,"principal_ingredient_6":null,"principal_ingredient_7":null,"subtitle":"ROASTED PEPPER & TOMATO SPREAD","freeRecipe":false,"ingredient_1":"3 kg red bell peppers","ingredient_2":"1 kg ripe tomatoes","ingredient_3":"1 large eggplant","ingredient_4":"2 carrots","ingredient_5":"1/2 cup sunflower oil","ingredient_6":"2 tbsp sugar (optional)","ingredient_7":"1 tbsp salt","ingredient_8":"2 bay leaves","ingredient_9":"1/2 tsp black pepper","ingredient_10":"Optional: 1-2 chili peppers for spicy version","step_1":"Roast peppers and eggplant in 200°C (400°F) oven or on gas flame until skins char","step_2":"Place in a bowl, cover with plastic wrap, and let steam for 20 minutes","step_3":"Peel charred skins, remove seeds from peppers, and stems","step_4":"Grate tomatoes (discard skins) or finely chop","step_5":"Grate carrots","step_6":"Pass peppers and eggplant through a food mill or finely chop","step_7":"In a large heavy pot, combine all ingredients except oil","step_8":"Cook over low heat for 45-60 minutes, stirring frequently","step_9":"Slowly add oil in a thin stream while stirring","step_10":"Continue cooking until mixture thickens and a wooden spoon leaves a trail","step_11":"Remove bay leaves","step_12":"Pour hot into sterilized jars, seal immediately","step_13":"Store in cool, dark place"}
