 you","step_10":"Repeat with remaining leaves and filling","step_11":"Line a large pot with unused or torn grape leaves","step_12":"Arrange dolmades tightly in layers","step_13":"Add remaining olive oil, remaining lemon juice, and enough water to barely cover","step_14":"Place an inverted plate on top to keep dolmades submerged","step_15":"Bring to a boil, reduce heat to low, and simmer for 45 minutes","step_16":"Let cool to room temperature (traditionally served warm or room temperature)","step_17":"Serve with lemon wedges"}
