ng upright","step_10":"Pour tomato juice around peppers (not inside)","step_11":"Add water if needed to come halfway up peppers","step_12":"Place an inverted plate on top to keep peppers submerged","step_13":"Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer for 40 minutes","step_14":"Serve warm with plain yogurt on the side"}
